1
00:00:22,810 --> 00:00:26,694
♪The night wind shakes off
the withered leaves♪

2
00:00:29,094 --> 00:00:33,709
♪I open the window and gaze at the moon♪

3
00:00:35,582 --> 00:00:40,720
♪Haze spreads across the river,
lanterns drifting♪

4
00:00:42,058 --> 00:00:47,067
♪I hear the memories rustling♪

5
00:00:48,278 --> 00:00:51,199
♪Garden flowers shed petals one by one♪

6
00:00:51,410 --> 00:00:54,501
♪Candlelight flickers,
swaying with melancholy♪

7
00:00:54,798 --> 00:00:59,033
♪I sigh by the lamp over the long night♪

8
00:01:01,018 --> 00:01:03,926
♪Past memories unfold scene by scene♪

9
00:01:04,224 --> 00:01:07,110
♪It's all your face♪

10
00:01:07,420 --> 00:01:12,202
♪Boldly trampling over my heart♪

11
00:01:12,202 --> 00:01:16,782
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for love miswritten♪

12
00:01:16,782 --> 00:01:18,781
♪And another for youth passed♪

13
00:01:18,984 --> 00:01:24,766
♪With endless sorrow,
I once traced your silhouette♪

14
00:01:25,150 --> 00:01:29,461
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for joy and sorrow♪

15
00:01:29,461 --> 00:01:31,969
♪And another for parting and reunion♪

16
00:01:32,215 --> 00:01:42,432
♪I write until splendor fades,
and I am no more♪

17
00:01:45,882 --> 00:01:48,716
=Prelude of the White Snake=

18
00:01:48,716 --> 00:01:51,634
=Episode 10=

19
00:01:55,040 --> 00:01:57,120
You guys, finish them all.

20
00:02:20,199 --> 00:02:22,360
I won't be a third wheel then.

21
00:02:22,960 --> 00:02:24,319
I'll take my leave.

22
00:02:24,479 --> 00:02:26,520
Qing, come take a stroll
with me around town.

23
00:02:26,520 --> 00:02:28,360
Come on, take a stroll, let's go.

24
00:02:29,039 --> 00:02:30,439
What are you doing?

25
00:02:31,680 --> 00:02:33,039
What? You're leaving?

26
00:02:33,039 --> 00:02:34,039
Won't you have some tea?

27
00:02:45,319 --> 00:02:46,479
Here, Miss Bai.

28
00:02:47,759 --> 00:02:49,759
Try the tea and see if it is good.

29
00:02:54,919 --> 00:02:56,240
How is it? Good?

30
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:58,000
Yes.

31
00:02:58,199 --> 00:03:01,400
If you like it, you can have Xu Xian
brew it for you from now on.

32
00:03:02,680 --> 00:03:05,280
Don't let that cold, distant look
fool you.

33
00:03:05,840 --> 00:03:09,479
When he was a kid,
he was always hardworking.

34
00:03:09,680 --> 00:03:12,240
Aunt, why are you bringing all this up?

35
00:03:12,240 --> 00:03:14,680
What? Don't you want me to tell her

36
00:03:14,680 --> 00:03:16,159
about your embarrassing stories?

37
00:03:17,319 --> 00:03:19,800
It's fine, Aunt. Please, go on.

38
00:03:21,919 --> 00:03:24,719
Why are all your voices so hoarse?

39
00:03:27,840 --> 00:03:31,240
My throat is a bit sore
because of too many demon hunts lately.

40
00:03:31,759 --> 00:03:33,319
Here, have some tea to soothe it.

41
00:03:37,360 --> 00:03:39,159
The Zhao family's gift has arrived.

42
00:03:39,520 --> 00:03:40,520
Xu Xian,

43
00:03:41,240 --> 00:03:44,639
you'd better talk things out
than bottling them up.

44
00:03:44,639 --> 00:03:46,319
I have things to do. I'll take my leave.

45
00:03:49,400 --> 00:03:50,400
That kid...

46
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:54,240
Actually, about that mess
with the Zhao family,

47
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:57,759
he was the one who resolved it for you.

48
00:03:59,240 --> 00:04:00,240
Madam Zhao.

49
00:04:01,639 --> 00:04:03,879
I thought this jade carving
was smashed to pieces.

50
00:04:05,120 --> 00:04:09,080
Young Master Zhao had already
swapped the real one with a fake.

51
00:04:09,879 --> 00:04:12,599
Young Master Xu redeemed it
from the pawnshop

52
00:04:12,599 --> 00:04:13,919
to make amends to us.

53
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:17,480
Miss Bai clashed with your son

54
00:04:17,480 --> 00:04:19,079
because of me.

55
00:04:19,319 --> 00:04:20,639
She meant no offense.

56
00:04:21,360 --> 00:04:22,680
I beg your forgiveness.

57
00:04:23,319 --> 00:04:25,839
I know this jade carving
holds great meaning for you.

58
00:04:27,040 --> 00:04:28,759
I hope that by redeeming it,

59
00:04:29,560 --> 00:04:31,079
I can offer you some comfort.

60
00:04:33,480 --> 00:04:35,000
Thank you, Young Master Xu.

61
00:04:37,519 --> 00:04:39,199
I failed to discipline
the child properly.

62
00:04:41,839 --> 00:04:42,920
Rest assured.

63
00:04:43,360 --> 00:04:46,480
I will surely clear Miss Bai's name

64
00:04:46,759 --> 00:04:49,959
so as to live up to your sincere love.

65
00:04:50,600 --> 00:04:51,600
No.

66
00:04:53,240 --> 00:04:56,120
No, we...

67
00:04:58,600 --> 00:04:59,600
Thank you.

68
00:04:59,959 --> 00:05:00,959
I'll take my leave now.

69
00:05:12,639 --> 00:05:15,480
Find out how much
Xu Xian paid for the jade,

70
00:05:15,959 --> 00:05:17,759
and prepare a gift of equal value.

71
00:05:18,439 --> 00:05:19,920
Send it to his aunt.

72
00:05:20,720 --> 00:05:22,639
As for that wretched brat,

73
00:05:23,079 --> 00:05:26,120
you bring him back here right now.

74
00:05:26,560 --> 00:05:27,759
And tell him

75
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:31,399
if he keeps making a scene like this,

76
00:05:31,800 --> 00:05:34,959
I'll kick him out of the Zhao family!

77
00:05:35,839 --> 00:05:36,839
Yes.

78
00:05:39,600 --> 00:05:41,199
But why didn't he say anything

79
00:05:41,199 --> 00:05:43,160
and ran off? What does that mean?

80
00:05:43,800 --> 00:05:47,079
He has been tough on the outside,
yet soft on the inside.

81
00:05:47,759 --> 00:05:51,120
He always does things secretly,
for both me and you.

82
00:05:51,560 --> 00:05:52,560
He ran off just now,

83
00:05:52,759 --> 00:05:55,079
not because he doesn't care,
but he cares too much.

84
00:05:55,480 --> 00:05:57,879
From the way he looked at you,
he's afraid you'd be mad,

85
00:05:58,240 --> 00:05:59,399
or guilty,

86
00:06:00,560 --> 00:06:03,040
and even more,
that you'd reject his kindness.

87
00:06:03,560 --> 00:06:06,279
He just didn't know how to face you.

88
00:06:07,040 --> 00:06:09,680
Why would I ever reject him? I...

89
00:06:11,240 --> 00:06:12,839
I can tell

90
00:06:13,120 --> 00:06:16,040
that you both care for each other.

91
00:06:19,480 --> 00:06:21,519
(He did that because he cares about me.)

92
00:06:22,879 --> 00:06:24,079
(He really cares.)

93
00:06:47,600 --> 00:06:50,079
(Suzhen has been so wrapped up
with that Xu Xian lately,)

94
00:06:50,079 --> 00:06:51,680
(and has no time for me anymore.)

95
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:16,879
So you're that mixed-blood demon?

96
00:07:18,199 --> 00:07:20,600
I've never seen
a little snake with horns before.

97
00:07:21,279 --> 00:07:22,439
So adorable.

98
00:07:23,360 --> 00:07:24,800
I'll take you as my younger sister.

99
00:07:25,160 --> 00:07:26,839
What do you think?

100
00:07:35,639 --> 00:07:36,639
Look.

101
00:07:56,600 --> 00:07:57,600
Wait.

102
00:07:57,759 --> 00:08:00,040
I can feel
Suzhen's spiritual power in this rain.

103
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:44,559
You're so distracted.
You've already lost the whole game.

104
00:08:45,120 --> 00:08:46,960
There's no need to keep going.

105
00:08:53,639 --> 00:08:54,639
I didn't even notice

106
00:08:54,679 --> 00:08:55,799
I was losing this badly.

107
00:08:56,720 --> 00:08:59,600
Young Master Xu,
Miss Bai sent you a message.

108
00:09:00,080 --> 00:09:01,080
It's raining.

109
00:09:01,399 --> 00:09:04,240
She's waiting for you on Shimen Bridge
to bring her an umbrella.

110
00:09:07,879 --> 00:09:08,879
Go now!

111
00:09:08,919 --> 00:09:10,000
She's giving you an excuse.

112
00:09:11,879 --> 00:09:13,639
You two just date.

113
00:09:13,840 --> 00:09:16,320
Why drag us folks into it?

114
00:09:16,879 --> 00:09:18,240
I've been here twice already.

115
00:09:18,240 --> 00:09:19,360
I had enough.

116
00:09:19,360 --> 00:09:20,519
I won't come again.

117
00:09:20,960 --> 00:09:23,080
See? Even the street vendor
can't stand it anymore.

118
00:09:30,120 --> 00:09:31,600
If you lose a game of chess,

119
00:09:32,720 --> 00:09:36,039
you can always play another round.

120
00:09:37,679 --> 00:09:39,519
But relationships are different.

121
00:09:40,720 --> 00:09:45,039
If you miss it,
then it won't come again.

122
00:09:47,879 --> 00:09:48,879
Leaving now?

123
00:10:01,557 --> 00:10:05,441
♪The night wind shakes off
the withered leaves♪

124
00:10:07,841 --> 00:10:12,456
♪I open the window and gaze at the moon♪

125
00:10:14,329 --> 00:10:19,467
♪Haze spreads across the river,
lanterns drifting♪

126
00:10:20,805 --> 00:10:25,814
♪I hear the memories rustling♪

127
00:10:27,025 --> 00:10:29,946
♪Garden flowers shed petals one by one♪

128
00:10:30,157 --> 00:10:33,248
♪Candlelight flickers,
swaying with melancholy♪

129
00:10:33,360 --> 00:10:34,360
Why don't you use that?

130
00:10:36,840 --> 00:10:37,919
I don't need to.

131
00:10:39,679 --> 00:10:40,679
You fool.

132
00:10:41,679 --> 00:10:42,679
What?

133
00:10:43,399 --> 00:10:44,399
Use the umbrella now.

134
00:10:46,167 --> 00:10:50,949
♪Boldly trampling over my heart♪

135
00:10:50,949 --> 00:10:55,529
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for love miswritten♪

136
00:10:55,529 --> 00:10:57,528
♪And another for youth passed♪

137
00:10:57,731 --> 00:11:03,513
♪With endless sorrow,
I once traced your silhouette♪

138
00:11:03,897 --> 00:11:08,208
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for joy and sorrow♪

139
00:11:08,208 --> 00:11:10,716
♪And another for parting and reunion♪

140
00:11:10,962 --> 00:11:18,720
♪I write until splendor fades,
and I am no more♪

141
00:11:18,720 --> 00:11:19,720
Look good?

142
00:11:22,960 --> 00:11:23,960
Yes.

143
00:11:28,080 --> 00:11:29,480
Thank you for the compliment.

144
00:11:29,879 --> 00:11:32,000
I believe I deserve it.

145
00:11:33,440 --> 00:11:35,759
Can you stop being like this?

146
00:11:37,759 --> 00:11:38,759
Like what?

147
00:11:38,759 --> 00:11:39,759
Just...

148
00:11:41,559 --> 00:11:43,080
Just the way you are.

149
00:11:43,879 --> 00:11:44,879
But

150
00:11:46,480 --> 00:11:47,600
I'm only like this with you.

151
00:11:50,398 --> 00:11:55,523
♪Haze spreads across the river,
lanterns drifting♪

152
00:11:57,159 --> 00:12:00,919
Well, can't you be
a little more reserved?

153
00:12:04,039 --> 00:12:05,919
So you like reserved girls.

154
00:12:06,600 --> 00:12:07,600
I don't.

155
00:12:08,440 --> 00:12:10,840
Greetings, sir.

156
00:12:14,879 --> 00:12:17,200
I think you do like that kind.

157
00:12:17,200 --> 00:12:18,279
I don't.

158
00:12:18,279 --> 00:12:20,039
- You do.
- I don't.

159
00:12:20,039 --> 00:12:21,759
- You do.
- I don't.

160
00:12:21,759 --> 00:12:22,759
- You do.
- Take this.

161
00:12:23,720 --> 00:12:24,720
I don't.

162
00:12:24,720 --> 00:12:25,720
You do.

163
00:12:27,080 --> 00:12:28,360
You do.

164
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:30,000
- You do.
- I don't.

165
00:12:30,200 --> 00:12:31,399
You do.

166
00:12:31,399 --> 00:12:33,279
- I don't.
- You do.

167
00:12:33,683 --> 00:12:39,465
♪With endless sorrow,
I once traced your silhouette♪

168
00:12:39,849 --> 00:12:44,160
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for joy and sorrow♪

169
00:12:44,919 --> 00:12:47,720
I think you look better
in women's clothes.

170
00:12:54,799 --> 00:12:56,759
Don't walk away. You'll get soaked.

171
00:12:56,759 --> 00:12:59,159
You'll catch a cold. Wait for me.

172
00:13:13,519 --> 00:13:15,399
(Just now, I thought
he finally got the hang.)

173
00:13:15,399 --> 00:13:16,928
(Now he's back to his usual self.)

174
00:13:17,279 --> 00:13:18,279
Young Master Xu,

175
00:13:19,159 --> 00:13:21,639
I'll get all wet if you
hold the umbrella like this.

176
00:13:23,399 --> 00:13:25,639
Sorry, I didn't notice it.

177
00:13:34,960 --> 00:13:37,679
You've been holding it for a while.
You must be tired.

178
00:13:38,039 --> 00:13:40,039
How about I hold it for a bit?

179
00:13:43,039 --> 00:13:44,039
I'm not tired.

180
00:13:56,840 --> 00:13:59,639
The weather is strange.

181
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:01,320
It rains on and off.

182
00:14:07,960 --> 00:14:08,960
Watch out!

183
00:14:59,919 --> 00:15:00,919
Great!

184
00:15:02,080 --> 00:15:03,080
Great!

185
00:15:09,200 --> 00:15:10,360
My dear.

186
00:15:11,559 --> 00:15:12,759
Don't be sad.

187
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:17,320
Look, you can rest easy now.

188
00:15:18,240 --> 00:15:19,240
Do you think

189
00:15:19,240 --> 00:15:22,480
we can start planning their wedding?

190
00:15:25,000 --> 00:15:27,080
We still need to push a little more.

191
00:15:27,519 --> 00:15:28,759
Just a little more.

192
00:15:28,759 --> 00:15:29,919
What for?

193
00:15:33,679 --> 00:15:34,679
Wenhui,

194
00:15:35,200 --> 00:15:37,600
I know these years
haven't been easy for you.

195
00:15:38,600 --> 00:15:40,840
But today, you've finally

196
00:15:42,039 --> 00:15:44,799
cleared the clouds.

197
00:15:45,480 --> 00:15:49,879
♪And seen the moon♪

198
00:15:53,200 --> 00:15:54,200
Annoying.

199
00:15:54,399 --> 00:15:55,639
You're still the same.

200
00:15:56,840 --> 00:15:58,120
Seeing them

201
00:15:58,279 --> 00:16:01,559
just reminds me of the old days.

202
00:16:03,440 --> 00:16:07,320
Look at you. You're so annoying.

203
00:16:22,039 --> 00:16:24,720
We're home.

204
00:16:27,679 --> 00:16:28,679
We're home.

205
00:16:58,425 --> 00:17:02,584
♪I also gave my youth to someone♪

206
00:17:05,051 --> 00:17:09,429
♪I must admit, you made the journey♪

207
00:17:10,972 --> 00:17:16,797
♪When loving you
became instinct, what's left♪

208
00:17:17,566 --> 00:17:22,033
♪Seals a fate too brutal to amend♪

209
00:17:24,898 --> 00:17:29,339
♪Clumsy and new, we gave our first kiss♪

210
00:17:31,535 --> 00:17:36,265
♪Never thought passionate eyes
would turn cold♪

211
00:17:37,477 --> 00:17:43,590
♪I thought of pulling away,
but I'd barely begun♪

212
00:17:44,253 --> 00:17:50,035
♪Having loved you so deep,
how could I love another♪

213
00:17:50,035 --> 00:17:56,298
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

214
00:17:56,608 --> 00:18:02,967
♪Though I'm stubborn,
I never stopped you from loving others♪

215
00:18:03,138 --> 00:18:10,505
♪I shouldn't have been so foolish
to think there was still hope♪

216
00:18:10,790 --> 00:18:16,337
♪But you won't even admit what we had♪

217
00:18:16,828 --> 00:18:23,038
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

218
00:18:23,348 --> 00:18:30,121
♪Though I have questions,
I never questioned you♪

219
00:18:31,118 --> 00:18:36,771
♪I'll lock you away and set myself free♪

220
00:18:37,605 --> 00:18:42,013
♪After all, I'm the one you deny♪

221
00:18:42,778 --> 00:18:45,366
♪Having ever loved♪
